ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/7dd9fcb0b06ace32287bf2d44faf00b2.webm?t=1747735891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/7dd9fcb0b06ace32287bf2d44faf00b2.mp4?t=1747735891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/2e5c5d07c32d77c5378e5e198881eb7a.avif?t=1747735891\" /></div><br>We\u2019re going to level with you... an alien threat is terrifying, terrifyingly fun! Look, the world is already pretty beat up as it is. Who's going to notice if you cause a little bit more destruction while saving the day? People have insurance it's fine...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/b728c6f51337124eef56a185bc9d939c.poster.avif?t=1747735891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/b728c6f51337124eef56a185bc9d939c.webm?t=1747735891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502190/extras/b728c6f51337124eef56a185bc9d939c.mp4?t=1747735891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "From Space is a solo and co-op action-shooter for squads up to four players. Take on the challenge of liberating the earth from an alien infestation with your friends, using over-the-top weaponry in a post-apocalyptic world with awesomely stylized graphics. The apocalypse has never been so much fun!",
